    <!--
      DPHv12 XML — the vzor in force 1. 1. 2012 - 31. 12. 2017.

      Same telo as DPHv18/DPHv20 (r01..r38, splneniePodmienok before r32); the
      hlavicka is where it differs, and it differs in ways the XSD enforces:

        * `tel` and `fax` are STRUCTURED (predcislie + cislo), where the 2018
          vzor replaced them with a plain `telefon` and an `email`. Same in
          `opravnenaOsoba`, which carries a `tel` and no email at all.
        * `osoba` has no `zastupca69aa` — the § 69aa representative arrives
          with the 2018 vzor.

      A phone held as one string goes in `cislo`, and `fax` is emitted empty
      rather than omitted: the schema requires the element to be there.
    -->
