    <!--
      DPHv18 / DPHv20 XML — the vzory in force 1. 1. 2018 - 31. 12. 2020.

      ONE template for two version records, because the two SCHEMAS are
      byte-identical apart from their own documentation string (DPH2018 vs
      DPH2020). The FORMS are not: r18 is the § 81 deregistration liability in
      the 2018 vzor and the § 48ca / § 48d / § 48e daň in the 2020 one, which
      folded § 81 into r01-r04 instead. That difference lives in the row
      definitions, the only place it can — and it is exactly why a
      wrong-vintage return validates perfectly. Nothing in a finished document
      says which vzor it was written for.

      Against the 2021 vzor: r38 exists here (dodatočné DP, daň na úhradu) and
      splneniePodmienok sits BEFORE r32 rather than after it. Both are element
